{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"heavy_knight_body","model_identifier":"heavy_knight_body","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## heavy_knight_body\n\nThe Dreadnought's body without his plate harness and without his mace (Patch 7), split from `heavy_knight` (Jade's model, unchanged). Worn with `armour_dreadnought_harness` (his tier 8 harness) and holding `dreadnought_mace_held` in `slot_hand_r`, it looks exactly like `heavy_knight`.\n\n- Cubes: 69 (heavy_knight's 146, less the 46 mace cubes and the 32 harness cubes, plus 1 new `doublet`). Texture 256x256, embedded; heavy_knight's own pixels, repacked to the faces used (1 texel per unit on big parts, 2 on the helm face, buckle and belt details, as the source), plus the doublet at 1 texel per unit.\n- Scale 1 unit = 2.8125 cm. Origin on the ground between the feet at y = 0, faces -Z. Height to the top of the helm y = 83 (2.33 m), plume tip y = 90 (2.53 m).\n- What is left on the body: helm, grille, hinges and the 3-bone plume (kept so he stays recognisable), the dark steel gorget (kept: without it the neck between the helm and the doublet is open), the team-blue belt, buckle, keepers and pouch, the breeches (`pelvis`), his bare arms and legs, leather bracers, fists, and the leather boots with straps and buckles.\n- New: `doublet` on `torso`, x -12.5..12.5, y 42.5..60.5, z -7.5..7.5: a padded, diamond-quilted arming doublet in his browns with a laced front. It sits 0.5 units inside the cuirass on every side and on the same bone, so it never shows while the harness is worn.\n- Skeleton: every group of heavy_knight with the same names, origins, rotations, nesting and uuids, including `pauldron_r`, `pauldron_l`, `pauldron_lame_r`, `pauldron_lame_l`, the four `skirt_*` groups and every `slot_*` group. Groups whose cubes all moved to the harness (`pauldron_*`, `skirt_*`) are empty. The `mace` group (with `slot_mace_head` and `slot_mace_grip_l` inside it) is removed from `slot_hand_r`, which is empty; those two slots now live in `dreadnought_mace_held` (`slot_mace_head`, `slot_grip_l`).\n- Clips: heavy_knight's nine clips copied (body bones unchanged) (`idle`, `walk`, `run`, `attack_smash` key 0.875 s, `attack_swing` key 0.708 s, `injured`, `death` markers release 0.333 / land 1.583, `warcry` marker roar 0.750, `jump` markers takeoff 0.708 / land 1.167). Move speeds as heavy_knight: walk 34.0 u/s (0.96 m/s), run 88.0 u/s (2.48 m/s). The left hand is still solved onto the mace's second grip (11 units from the right fist toward the pommel), so a two-handed weapon in `slot_hand_r` with a `slot_grip_l` 11 units back sits in both fists. In heavy_knight's `death` the `mace` bone has its own keys (the mace is let go at 0.333 s and falls to the ground at his right front). With the mace group gone they had no bone here (the converter rejects keys on a missing bone), so they were moved, unchanged, to `dreadnought_mace_held`'s own `death` clip; the other eight clips and every body bone's keys in `death` are heavy_knight's, unchanged.\n- Hit box as heavy_knight: 55 x 81 x 37 units, z -25..12.\n- Attachment points (rest pivots): slot_head (0, 82, 0) on head; slot_back (0, 52, 9), slot_quiver (5, 55, 9), slot_shoulder_r (17, 64, 0), slot_carry (0, 50, -10) on torso; slot_hand_r (18, 29.5, 0) on hand_r (empty: the held weapon goes here); slot_shield_l (-22.5, 40, 0) on arm_lower_l; slot_hand_l (-18, 29.5, 0) on hand_l; slot_hip_r (14.5, 36, 3), slot_hip_l (-14.5, 36, 3) on hips.\n- Team colour: the belt (RGB 52, 96, 178).\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-12,30,-7],"to":[12,37,7],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,37,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[182,98,206,105],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[230,98,244,105],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[206,98,230,105],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,107,14,114],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[11,71,35,85],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[35,71,59,85],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7dfb6bf0-fb62-541d-a3b6-6caecf6f6125"},{"name":"belt","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-14,36,-8.5],"to":[14,42,8.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,37,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[82,107,110,113],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[138,107,155,113],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[110,107,138,113],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[155,107,172,113],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[80,53,108,70],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[108,53,136,70],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a38526cc-55b7-5f94-8c71-3ad99ab68794"},{"name":"belt_keeper_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[9,35.5,-8.75],"to":[11,42.5,-8.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,37,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[135,71,139,85],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[143,71,144,85],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[139,71,143,85],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[144,71,145,85],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[116,132,120,133],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[120,132,124,133],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7be5489e-08d9-5518-a193-a7d32b035442"},{"name":"belt_keeper_l","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-11,35.5,-8.75],"to":[-9,42.5,-8.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,37,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[139,71,135,85],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[145,71,144,85],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[143,71,139,85],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[144,71,143,85],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[120,132,116,133],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[124,132,120,133],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d6e66121-c76c-5ee4-a360-301751ac3008"},{"name":"buckle_top","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling